{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"弥迦书","commonName":"弥迦书","title":"弥迦书","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"2f452e45ab0a57cd41ee90eea1e3a317e2fb9fa13c9d1eb63e3a525aa69770b1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["犹大王约坦、亚哈斯和希西迦执政期间，耶和华把祂的话传给了摩利沙人弥迦。他看到了有关撒玛利亚和耶路撒冷的异象。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["审判将临"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"万民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们都要听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地和地上的万物啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要侧耳倾听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华从祂的圣殿里作证指控你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，耶和华离开祂的居所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从天降临，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"脚踏大地的高处。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"群山在祂脚下熔化，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹如火中的蜡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山谷崩裂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岩石如水沿山坡倾泻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这一切都是因为雅各的叛逆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家的罪恶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的叛逆在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂不是在撒玛利亚吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大的丘坛在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂不是在耶路撒冷吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“所以，耶和华说：我要使撒玛利亚沦为荒野的废墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成为栽种葡萄园的地方。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把她的石头抛进山谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"露出她的根基。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她所有的神像都要被打碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她所得的嫖资都要化为灰烬；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要毁灭她的一切偶像。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她以嫖资得来的偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也要被用作妓女的嫖资。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["先知的哀伤"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"为此，我要痛哭哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要赤身光脚行走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像豺狼哀嚎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如鸵鸟悲鸣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为撒玛利亚的创伤无法救治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"已经祸及犹大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直逼我百姓的城门，直逼耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在迦特宣扬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"千万不要哭泣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在伯·亚弗拉的灰尘中打滚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沙斐的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们将满面羞辱地赤身流亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒南的居民不敢出城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伯·以薛在痛哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们已失去它的庇护。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玛律的居民痛苦不堪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渴望得到拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华已把灾难降到耶路撒冷的城门。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拉吉的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用骏马套车逃命吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你们首先唆使少女锡安犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你们身上看到了以色列的罪恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去向摩利设·迦特赠送告别礼物吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚革悉人必令以色列诸王受骗上当。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玛利沙的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使征服者到你们那里。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的领袖","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"要躲到亚杜兰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"犹大人啊，你们要剃光头发，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为你们所爱的儿女悲伤；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要剃得如秃鹰一样光秃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们要被掳到远方。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“以色列的领袖”希伯来文是“以色列的荣耀”。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}